-- (7) a hospital patient who came to Israel for hospitalisation or fell ill there, and who "but for the period of his
-- hospitalisation" would not be within (a)(2).  200 days in the tax year, none before:
--   h0 = 30: 170 days remain, below 183 -> (a)(2) would not apply -> he is in the class -> deemed foreign.
--   h0 = 17: 183 remain -> (a)(2)(a) still applies -> not in the class -> resident.  h0 = 18: 182 remain -> in the class.
