`a hospital patient who came for it: ` came `, hospitalised` h0 `,` h1 `,` h2 `days` MEANS `a hospital patient` WITH `he came to Israel for hospitalisation, or fell ill while in Israel` IS came, `the days of hospitalisation in the tax year` IS h0, `the days of hospitalisation in the tax year before it` IS h1, `the days of hospitalisation in the tax year before that` IS h2
